    {
      "id": "answer-space",
      "name": "二分答案：最小可行速度",
      "trigger_signal": "找能在 h 小時內完成工作的最小速度，而非找陣列元素。",
      "keywords": [
        "二分答案",
        "最少天數",
        "最小速度",
        "可行性",
        "最小的最大值"
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "piles 非空、每堆為正整數，h >= piles.length，保證存在可行速度。",
        "每小時只處理一堆；速度 k 增加時所需時間不會增加。",
        "堆大小 <= 10^9、堆數 <= 10^4，Java/C++ 累加使用 64 位整數。"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        {
          "scenario": "可行性隨答案變化是 false、true、false。",
          "reason": "沒有單調性就不能因一次可行或不可行排除整側；『最少』關鍵字本身不足以使用二分。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "答案範圍 [1,max(piles)]。check(k) 判斷 sum(ceil(p/k)) <= h：速度越大，所需時間越少，所以是 false→true。可行時保留 mid 並向左尋找，不可行時 left=mid+1。例 [3,6,7,11], h=8，答案 4。延伸的運貨題需用容量範圍 [max(weights),sum(weights)]，並維持原順序貪心計算天數；不是把此處的時間公式直接照搬。",
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n log M)",
        "space": "O(1)",
        "reason": "M=max(piles)，每次可行性檢查 O(n)，搜尋速度共 O(log M) 次。"
      },
      "code": {
        "python": {
          "lines": [
            "def min_eating_speed(piles, h):",
            "    def feasible(speed):",
            "        return sum((p + speed - 1) // speed for p in piles) <= h",
            "    left, right = 1, max(piles)  # 已知右端可行",
            "    while left < right:",
            "        mid = left + (right - left) // 2",
            "        if feasible(mid):  # 找第一個 true",
            "            right = mid",
            "        else:",
            "            left = mid + 1",
            "    return left"
          ]
        },
        "java": {
          "lines": [
            "class Solution {",
            "    public int minEatingSpeed(int[] piles, int h) {",
            "        int left = 1, right = 1;",
            "        for (int p : piles) right = Math.max(right, p); // 可行上界",
            "        while (left < right) {",
            "            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;",
            "            long hours = 0;",
            "            for (int p : piles) hours += (p + (long) mid - 1) / mid; // 向上取整",
            "            if (hours <= h) right = mid; // 可行，仍保留 mid",
            "            else left = mid + 1;",
            "        }",
            "        return left;",
            "    }",
            "}"
          ]
        },
        "cpp": {
          "lines": [
            "#include <vector>",
            "#include <algorithm>",
            "int minEatingSpeed(const std::vector<int>& piles, int h) {",
            "    int left = 1, right = *std::max_element(piles.begin(), piles.end());",
            "    while (left < right) {",
            "        int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;",
            "        long long hours = 0;",
            "        for (int p : piles) hours += (p + static_cast<long long>(mid) - 1) / mid;",
            "        if (hours <= h) right = mid; // 可行，搜尋更小速度",
            "        else left = mid + 1;",
            "    }",
            "    return left;",
            "}"
          ]
        }
      },
